# "A creature YOU control": with the delayed ability set up (Bot1 pays {2}{U} and removes the counter during turn 4's
# declare blockers step), Bot2's Elvish Mystic deals its combat damage to Bot1 and Bot1 draws nothing. The positive
# control is flitterwing-nuisance-draws-for-combat-damage-this-turn-only (Bot1's own creature draws). Bot1 does not play
# a land on turn 3, so its hand is 3 (after turn 1) + 1 (turn-3 draw) = 4 throughout, and it takes 1.

